kgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="191" width="1752" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note5" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D1  GroundingInput r1 / W47 / raw refs / prior bindings" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="998" y="390" width="1320" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note6" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D2  Evidence Reader를 통해 ReadEvidence(scope, lease)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="358" y="494" width="1200" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note7" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D3  Reader를 거친 raw / coverage / sourceVector 반환" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="358" y="598" width="1128" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note8" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D4  job j1: InterpretGrounding(raw, “두 graph”, prior)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2278" y="702" width="1272" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note9" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D5  j1 done: 두 extent의 b3 / 근거와 불확실성" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2278" y="806" width="864" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note10" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D6  현재 attempt 확인 후 b1,b2,b3와 dependency 기록" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2278" y="910" width="1032" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note11" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D7  j1b: 아직 모호한 관계의 추가 판단 시작" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2278" y="1014" width="672" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note12" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D8  r2 “아래 것만” / hold / a1 fence / j1b 취소 요청" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#B63732;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="998" y="1118" width="1056" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note13" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D9  a2: 정정 원문 + 이전 binding + 유효 O17/P3" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1638" y="1222" width="912" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note14" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D10  j2: 부분 재판단 / 필요한 추가 raw read 허용" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2278" y="1326" width="864" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note15" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D11  j1b late done: a1 != a2 → 상태 갱신 없이 폐기" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#B63732;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2278" y="1430" width="1008" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note16" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D12  j2 done: KEEP b1,b2 / REPLACE b3 → lower extent" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2278" y="1534" width="1248" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note17" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D13  a2 / r2 / source 유효성 확인 후 patch 기록" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2278" y="1638" width="936" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note18" parent="1" vertex="1" value="D14  GroundingProposal r2 / base version / raw dependency" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="998" y="1742" width="1368" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note19" parent="1" vertex="1" value="A: 새 lower extent와 keep/replace 의미를 같은 해석 책임이 직접 생산한다. crop/cache/부분 patch를 허용한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=26;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="1884" width="2106" height="33.800000000000004" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note20" parent="1" vertex="1" value="공통: 결과 대기 중 capture / 전사 / local stop은 계속된다. Request Controller가 최신 revision, 사용권, 근거와 base version을 검사한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="1941" width="2544" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note21" parent="1" vertex="1" value="채택 뒤에는 전체 요청 해석과 admission을 거쳐 응답 / 업무로 연결한다. 일부 지칭 실패는 해당 범위를 질문하며 앞의 의미를 임의 확정하지 않는다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#263445;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="1991" width="2088" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note22" parent="1" vertex="1" value="B 모델 왕복과 candidate 완료 통지는 메시지에 축약했다. 구조도에서 실제 호출과 반환을 표시한다. D 간격과 병행 정도는 성능 주장이 아니다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#758294;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="2042" width="1932" height="29.900000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note23" parent="1" vertex="1" value="실선: 요청 / 파랑 점선: 결과 / 빨강 점선: 정정과 무효화 / 회색 점선: 상태 게시 / 실행 trace가 아닌 같은 사건의 설계 예시" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=white;fontColor=#758294;fontSize=23;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacing=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="2097" width="1794" height="29.900000000000002" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
